-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",465,{
[14849]="7007403A\n1\tDefeat craven Ordâkhai on the hillside west of the village of Hanamíku (total: 6)\tCraven Ordâkhai hide upon the hillside west of the village of Hanamíku. Napísh believes you might frighten some of them from hiding if you shake some of the bushes in which they hide.\n2\tTalk to Napísh by the western entrance to the village of Hanamíku\tNapísh stands by the western entrance to the village of Hanamíku.\n",
[14850]="7007403B\n1\tComplete the cairn Rashlût began by the road north of the village of Hanamíku\tRashlût gave you some stones with which you can finish the cairn he began constructing north of the village of Hanamíku.\n2\tTalk to Rashlût in the centre of the village of Hanamíku\tRashlût waits for you in the centre of the village of Hanamíku.\n3\tComplete the cairn Rashlût began by the road south of the village of Hanamíku\tRashlût gave you some stones with which you can finish the cairn he began constructing south of the village of Hanamíku.\n4\tTalk to Rashlût in the centre of the village of Hanamíku\tRashlût waits for you in the centre of the village of Hanamíku.\n",
[14851]="70074041\n1\tMeet up with Lakhêpi outside the brigand camp of Kakidûr\tLakhêpi the Far-faring asked to meet up with you outside Kakidûr, the brigand camp west of the village of Hanamíku.\n2\tTalk to Lakhêpi outside the brigand camp of Kakidûr\tLakhêpi the Far-faring is outside the brigand camp of Kakidûr, west of the village of Hanamíku.\n3\tDefeat brigands at Kakidûr (total: 8)\030Collect abandoned Ordâkhai swords at Kakidûr (total: 3)\030Collect makeshift weapons at Kakidûr (total: 2)\tLakhêpi asked you to defeat brigands at their camp of Kakidûr and to pick up weapons you find lying about, all while paying attention to details that might make for interesting stories of the place.\n4\tBring the weapons you gathered to Lakhêpi outside the brigand camp of Kakidûr\tLakhêpi the Far-faring is outside the brigand camp of Kakidûr, west of the village of Hanamíku.\n",
[14852]="70074052\n1\tMeet up with Lakhêpi outside Mûl Erebu\tLakhêpi the Far-faring wanted to meet up with you outside Mûl Erebu to the south.\n2\tTalk to Lakhêpi outside Mûl Erebu\tLakhêpi the Far-faring stands outside Mûl Erebu, listening for something.\n3\tListen to the sound of scorpions\030Find a spot to listen from deep inside Mûl Erebu\030Collect stingers from scorpions in Mûl Erebu (total: 8)\tLakhêpi asked you to collect stingers from the scorpions that occupy Mûl Erebu, and to stand near the back of the town and listen to the sound of the scorpions.\n4\tBring the scorpion stingers to Lakhêpi outside Mûl Erebu\tLakhêpi the Far-faring stands outside Mûl Erebu, waiting for you to return.\n",
[14853]="70074055\n1\tSearch for Lakhêpi inside the brigand camp of Aptíku\tLakhêpi the Far-faring is likely somewhere within the brigand camp of Aptíku, and may need your help!\n2\tObserve Lakhêpi within the brigand camp of Aptíku\tYou found Lakhêpi the Far-faring inside Aptíku, but she does not appear to be in any immediate danger.\n3\tTalk to Lakhêpi inside the brigand camp of Aptíku\tYou found Lakhêpi the Far-faring inside Aptíku, but she does not appear to be in any immediate danger.\n4\tWatch the reaction of the brigands to your activity inside Aptíku\tYou found Lakhêpi the Far-faring inside Aptíku, but she does not appear to be in any immediate danger.\n5\tTalk to Lakhêpi inside the brigand camp of Aptíku\tYou found Lakhêpi the Far-faring inside Aptíku, but she does not appear to be in any immediate danger.\n",
[14854]="70074056\n1\tCollect snake meat in Pahar Hatokáli (total: 4)\030Collect kalorkhûn meat in Pahar Hatokáli (total: 2)\tLakhêpi asked you to gather snake and kalorkhûn meat from creatures in the wild for her to sample.\n2\tBring the meat you collected to Lakhêpi outside Aptíku\tLakhêpi the Far-faring agreed to meet you a safe distance outside the brigand camp of Aptíku to the south.\n3\tFind Bûlkharar, the wallowing spot of the alap-nâri, and note its smell\030Collect alap-nâri meat from the creatures at Bûlkharar (total: 4)\tLakhêpi asked you to find the wallowing spot of alap-nâri to the west, a place called Bûlkharar. She also wanted you to bring her some alap-nâri meat, so she can compare its taste to the other meats you gathered for her.\n4\tReturn the meat you collected to Lakhêpi outside Aptíku\tLakhêpi the Far-faring is waiting outside Aptíku for you to return.\n5\tPick up Lakhêpi's satchel and go in search of her\tYou should pick up her satchel and go in search of Lakhêpi. She could be in danger!\n6\tTalk to Lakhêpi in the village of Hanamíku\tLakhêpi has returned to the village of Hanamíku.\n",
[14855]="70074057\n1\tCollect wood suitable for carving south-east of Hanamíku (total: 3)\tSuitable wood for carving toys has been left south-east of the village of Hanamíku.\n2\tBring the suitable wood for carving to Pasumín in the village of Hanamíku\tThe toy-maker Pasumín is in the village of Hanamíku.\n3\tFind the children watching the soldiers train at the western gate of Hanamíku\tPasumín told you the children of Hanamíku were likely watching the soldiers train by the village's western gate.\n4\tTalk to Tebût, presumptive leader of the village children\tOne of the village children, Tebût, seems to be the leader.\n5\tTalk to Meshurûz at the west gate of Hanamíku\tMeshurûz oversees the training of his soldiers with an air of discontent.\n6\tSingle out Tebût, the leader of the children, and wave him away\tMeshurûz has asked you to wave away Tebût, the leader of the village children.\n7\tWait for the children to run away\tSuitably chastened, the village children scatter but may return.\n8\tTalk to Meshurûz by the west gate of Hanamíku\tMeshurûz is by the west gate of Hanamíku.\n9\tTalk to Pasumín in the village of Hanamíku\tThe toy-maker Pasumín is in the village of Hanamíku.\n",
[14856]="70074058\n1\tRecover Pasumín's sword from where he buried it beneath a tree high on the slope west of Hanamíku\tIn the days of his youth, Pasumín buried his sword beneath a tree on the high slopes west of the village of Hanamíku. Now he wants you to dig it up and recover it for him.\n2\tBring the sword you recovered to Pasumín in the village of Hanamíku\tPasumín is in the village of Hanamíku.\n3\tLeave Pasumín's old sword against the wall\tPasumín does not want to handle the sword, and has asked you to lean it against the wall.\n4\tTalk to Pasumín in the village of Hanamíku\tPasumín is in the village of Hanamíku.\n5\tTalk to Khârdab in the village of Hanamíku\tGuardsman Khârdab has called for your attention in the village of Hanamíku.\n6\tDefeat Ordâkhai soldiers at Bolo Thúki (total: 8)\tKhârdab asked you to defeat Ordâkhai soldiers at their camp of Bolo Thúki, south-east of Hanamíku.\n7\tTalk to Gurûni outside the Ordâkhai camp of Bolo Thúki\tThe Hamâti soldier Gurûni keeps a careful eye on the Ordâkhai camp of Bolo Thúki.\n8\tScout the entrance to Bolo Thúki to ensure the children of Hanamíku did not go that way\tGurûni has asked you to check by the entrance to Bolo Thúki and ensure that the children of Hanamíku have not snuck near the camp.\n9\tTalk to Gurûni outside the Ordâkhai camp of Bolo Thúki\tThe Hamâti soldier Gurûni keeps a careful eye on the Ordâkhai camp of Bolo Thúki.\n",
[14857]="70074095\n1\tFind the nearest entrance to Mut-hûru, south-east of Bolo Thúki\tGurûni worries that the children that were spying upon her might have departed not for the village but for the kergrim-haunted caves to the south-east of Bolo Thúki.\n2\tDefeat kergrim in Mut-hûru (total: 10)\030Search within Mut-hûru for the village children\tThe kergrim that stalk Mut-hûru should be defeated as you search for the village children.\n3\tReport to Khârdab in the village of Hanamíku\tGuardsman Khârdab is in the village of Hanamíku.\n4\tTalk to Zíri in the village of Hanamíku\tZíri, one of the village children, has a story to tell.\n5\tCheck to see if Pasumín is nearby\tPasumín has left his customary seat. Where has he gone?\n6\tTalk to Zíri in the village of Hanamíku\tZíri may have more to say concerning the disappearance of the children in Hanamíku.\n7\tTalk to Khârdab in the village of Hanamíku\tGuardsman Khârdab is in the village of Hanamíku.\n",
[14858]="70074109\n1\tTalk to Khârdab outside the encampment\tYou have come with Guardsman Khârdab to an encampment of the Ordâkhai to rescue Pasumín and the children of Hanamíku.\n2\tContinue further into the encampment in search of the children\tGuardsman Khârdab has stayed behind to hold off the pursuing Ordâkhai while you continue further into the encampment in search of the children and Pasumín.\n3\tTalk to Pasumín within Nakársong\tYou have found Pasumín within Nakársong, but the toy-maker has suffered many grievous wounds.\n4\tDefend the children of Hanamíku from the Ordâkhai of Nakársong\tPasumín has succumbed to the wounds he suffered, but his duty is not yet complete: you must stand in defence of the children!\n5\tTalk to Tebût in Nakársong\tYou have defended Tebût and his friends from the Ordâkhai of Nakársong.\n6\tRemain on your guard\tKhârdab has rejoined you, and desires to know if the children and the toy-maker are safe.\n7\tTalk to Khârdab in Nakársong\tKhârdab has rejoined you in the depths of Nakársong.\n",
[14859]="7007410A\n1\tTalk to Khârdab and go with him to rescue the endangered folk of Hanamíku\tGuardsman Khârdab is in the village of Hanamíku. He urgently wishes to go with you to rescue both the children and the toy-maker Pasumín.\n2\tTalk to Khârdab in Hanamíku\tGuardsman Khârdab has returned to the village of Hanamíku, celebrating your successes but grieving your failures.\n3\tCollect shovels near the forge-master (total: 3)\030Enlist the aid of Dumâkha\030Enlist the aid of Shêmu\tShovels for digging the grave can be found by the forge-master in Hanamíku, and Khârdab suggested a few villagers who should be willing to help.\n4\tReturn to Khârdab with the shovels\tGuardsman Khârdab is waiting for you to return with shovels and willing folk to wield them.\n",
[14860]="7007410F\n1\tTalk to Guardsman Khârdab at Khabur Pâshu\tGuardsman Khârdab stands in the cemetery of Khabur Pâshu near Hanamíku.\n2\tListen to Guardsman Khârdab at Khabur Pâshu\tGuardsman Khârdab stands in the cemetery of Khabur Pâshu near Hanamíku.\n3\tTalk to Guardsman Khârdab at Khabur Pâshu\tGuardsman Khârdab stands in the cemetery of Khabur Pâshu near Hanamíku.\n4\tStand with Guardsman Khârdab at Khabur Pâshu\tGuardsman Khârdab stands in the cemetery of Khabur Pâshu near Hanamíku.\n5\tTalk to Tebût at Khabur Pâshu\tTebût and his friends have come to the cemetery of Khabur Pâshu near Hanamíku.\n6\tListen to Tebût's question\tTebût and his friends have come to the cemetery of Khabur Pâshu near Hanamíku.\n7\tGive Tebût your answer to his question\tTebût and his friends have come to the cemetery of Khabur Pâshu near Hanamíku.\n8\tStand at Khabur Pâshu as Tebût and his friends visit Pasumín's grave\tTebût and his friends have come to the cemetery of Khabur Pâshu near Hanamíku.\n9\tTalk to Guardsman Khârdab at Khabur Pâshu\tGuardsman Khârdab stands in the cemetery of Khabur Pâshu near Hanamíku.\n",
[14861]="70074110\n1\tTalk to Khârdab and go with him for the sorrowful duty\tGuardsman Khârdab is in Hanamíku, waiting to go with you to prepare the grave.\n2\tTalk to Khârdab in Hanamíku\tKhârdab is in the village of Hanamíku.\n",
[14862]="70074118\n1\tWeed the dense patches of burned crops at Kirzâmur (total: 6)\030Pick up Ebnûr's rake\030Pick up Ebnûr's hoe\030Clean up half of the spilled grain\030Talk to Ebnûr's son Namtâru and tell him not to despair\tEbnûr has given you a number of tasks that will help his farm recover from the damage done to it by the Ordâkhai.\n2\tReturn to Ebnûr when you have completed the tasks he gave to you\tEbnûr is waiting at his farm for you to complete the tasks he gave to you.\n3\tTalk to Namtâru at his father's farm of Kirzâmur\tNamtâru has emerged from his despair and has something to say to you at his father's farm of Kirzâmur.\n",
[14863]="70074119\n1\tRetrieve Ebnûr's stolen shovel from the Ordâkhai camp of Bolo Thúki\tThe shovel with the valuable gemstone embedded in it was taken to the Ordâkhai camp of Bolo Thúki.\n2\tOne of the Ordâkhai at Bolo Thúki has apparently pried the valuable gemstone from the haft of Ebnûr's shovel!\t\n3\tDefeat Ordâkhai at Bolo Thúki and search for the stolen gemstone\tOne of the Ordâkhai at Bolo Thúki has apparently pried the valuable gemstone from the haft of Ebnûr's shovel! You should keep searching for it.\n4\tShow the stolen shovel and its valuable gemstone to Ebnûr's son Namtâru at Kirzâmur\tEbnûr's son Namtâru at the farm of Kirzâmur will be pleased that you have recovered the stolen shovel and its valuable gemstone.\n5\tGive the stolen shovel and its valuable gemstone to Ebnûr\tEbnûr wishes to speak with you now that you have returned triumphantly to Kirzâmur.\n",
[14864]="70074122\n1\tChief Provisioner Dunaïl asked you to consult soldiers throughout the war camp of Ingarûma to learn of their needs.\t\n2\tTalk to Chief Provisioner Dunaïl in the war camp of Ingarûma\tChief Provisioner Dunaïl stands by his tent in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n3\tCollect wrapped rations for the soldiers (total: 3)\030Collect water jar for a soldier\030Collect a bandage for a soldier\030Talk to Aradír the Overseer on behalf of the soldier Shimûz\tChief Provisioner Dunaïl told you where to find what you will need to satisfy each of the requests that were made of you.\n4\tHaving obtained what you need for the soldiers with whom you spoke, you should return to them and see if they are satisfied.\t\n5\tTalk to Chief Provisioner Dunaïl in the war camp of Ingarûma\tChief Provisioner Dunaïl stands by his tent in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n",
[14865]="70074123\n1\tDefeat hawks throughout Pahar Hatokáli (total: 6)\030Defeat snakes throughout Pahar Hatokáli (total: 4)\tZalûd the Maker of Plans asked you to defeat hawks and snakes throughout Pahar Hatokáli.\n2\tTalk to Zalûd the Maker of Plans in the war camp of Ingarûma\tZalûd the Maker of Plans is in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n",
[14866]="70074136\n1\tCollect swords from Ordâkhai throughout Pahar Hatokáli (total: 12)\tZalûd the Maker of Plans asked you to defeat Ordâkhai throughout Pahar Hatokáli and take their swords.\n2\tBring the swords to Zalûd the Maker of Plans in the war camp of Ingarûma\tZalûd the Maker of Plans is in the central tent of the war camp of Ingarûma.\n",
[14867]="70074137\n1\tShow the familiar blade to Kagûlu the Armsman in the war camp of Ingarûma\tKagûlu the Armsman is by the forges in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n2\tFind Hulâda somewhere near Ukh-bâra, south-east of Ingarûma\tKagûlu told you to seek Hulâda, the only living relative of the blade's owner, last told to scout the zizanu nests at Ukh-bâra in the swamps to the south-east of Ingarûma.\n3\tGive the familiar blade to Hulâda at Ukh-bâra\tHulâda stands by the edge of Ukh-bâra, the swamp-lands where the zizani make their nests in Pahar Hatokáli.\n4\tDefeat zizani at Ukh-bâra (total: 8)\tHulâda asked you to defeat the zizani at Ukh-bâra while he considers what to do with his slain cousin's sword.\n5\tTalk to Hulâda at Ukh-bâra\tHulâda stands by the edge of Ukh-bâra, the swamp-lands where the zizani make their nests in Pahar Hatokáli, trying to decide what to do with his slain cousin's sword.\n",
[14868]="70074138\n1\tBring Hulâda's blade to Kagûlu the Armsman in the war camp of Ingarûma\tKagûlu the Armsman is by the forge in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n2\tCollect fallen branches from the base of trees on the sloping path out of the war camp (total: 4)\030Talk to Chief Provisioner Dunaïl in the war camp of Ingarûma\tChief Provisioner Dunaïl stands by his tent in the war camp of Ingarûma, and will have the cloth Kagûlu requested. Fallen branches to stoke the flames can be collected by the trees on the sloping path out of the war camp, to the north of the forges, but Kagûlu warned you to exercise patience and not jump down the cliff.\n3\tTalk to Kagûlu the Armsman in the war camp of Ingarûma\tKagûlu the Armsman is by the forge in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n4\tStoke the fires for the forges at Ingarûma\tYou should stoke the fires of the forges at Ingarûma.\n5\tHeat billows from the forge\tHaving stoked the fires of the forges at Ingarûma, you now have only to wait.\n6\tTalk to Hulâda at the war camp of Ingarûma\tHulâda has come to the forges at the war camp of Ingarûma.\n7\tTalk to Kagûlu the Armsman at the war camp of Ingarûma\tKagûlu the Armsman is by the forges of the war camp of Ingarûma.\n",
[14869]="70074139\n1\tTalk to Kagûlu the Armsman in the war camp of Ingarûma\tKagûlu the Armsman is by the forges in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n2\tTalk to Kishâtal at the war camp of Ingarûma\tKishâtal is at the war camp of Ingarûma, down the slope to the south-east of the forges.\n3\tRetrieve broken swords from the scrap barrel to the east\tKishâtal disposed of his latest broken sword in a scrap barrel to the east, by the cliff's edge.\n4\tShow the assorted broken swords to Kishâtal at the war camp of Ingarûma\tKishâtal is at the war camp of Ingarûma. He will be able to identify whether you retrieved the correct pieces of his broken sword.\n5\tBring Kishâtal's broken sword to Kagûlu the Armsman in the war camp of Ingarûma\tKagûlu the Armsman is by the forges in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n",
[14870]="7007413A\n1\tPick up the axe Kagûlu suggested\030Pick up the spear Kagûlu suggested\tKagûlu the Armsman has suggested you bring an axe and a spear to Kishâtal so he can try them and see which one he likes best.\n2\tBring Kagûlu's suggested weapons to Kishâtal in the war camp of Ingarûma\tKishâtal is down the slope to the south-east of the forges in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n3\tDefeat zizani alongside Kishâtal at Ukh-bâra (total: 6)\030Defeat Ordâkhai alongside Kishâtal at the skirmish fields (total: 6)\tKishâtal is excited to test out each of the new weapons, and has encouraged you to fight alongside him by the zizanu nests at Ukh-bâra to the south-east and on the skirmish fields along the road to the east of the war camp.\n4\tTalk to Kishâtal at the war camp of Ingarûma\tKishâtal has returned to the war camp of Ingarûma.\n",
[14871]="7007413D\n1\tTalk to Kagûlu the Armsman at the war camp of Ingarûma\tKagûlu the Armsman is by the forges at the war camp of Ingarûma.\n2\tPick up the club Kagûlu suggested\tKagûlu the Armsman has suggested one more weapon that might be to Kishâtal's liking.\n3\tBring Kagûlu's last suggestion to Kishâtal in the war camp of Ingarûma\tKishâtal is down the slope to the south-east of the forges in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n4\tDefeat Orcs alongside Kishâtal at Roz Káskrauz (total: 8)\tKishâtal has decided to test out this last suggestion at the Orc camp of Roz Káskrauz, located to the east of the war camp.\n5\tTalk to Kishâtal at the war camp of Ingarûma\tKishâtal has returned to the war camp of Ingarûma.\n6\tTalk to Kagûlu the Armsman in the war camp of Ingarûma\tKagûlu the Armsman is by the forges in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n",
[14872]="70074149\n1\tTalk to Chief Provisioner Dunaïl in the war camp of Ingarûma\tChief Provisioner Dunaïl stands by his tent in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n2\tBring the wooden stave and bandages to Arimûl at the cross-road west of the war camp\tChief Provisioner Dunaïl gave you a wooden stave and bandages to bring to Arimûl, injured by a cross-road to the west of the war camp of Ingarûma.\n",
[14873]="7007414A\n1\tSearch for Ordâkhai outside the nearest entrance to the kergrim caves of Mut-hûru\tThe nearest entrance to the kergrim caves of Mut-hûru is located north of the road that runs east of Arimûl's position.\n2\tSearch the body of the slain Ordâkhai outside the kergrim caves\tThe nearest entrance to the kergrim caves of Mut-hûru is located north of the road that runs east of Arimûl's position. The body of an Ordâkhai soldier lies here!\n3\tCollect Ordâkhai trinkets from kergrim inside Mut-hûru (total: 8)\tKergrim inside the cave of Mut-hûru may have scavenged belongings from the Ordâkhai they killed.\n4\tMeet with Arimûl outside the main tent of the war camp of Ingarûma\tArimûl agreed to meet with you outside the main tent at the war camp of Ingarûma.\n5\tTalk to Shenzâmin beside the main tent of the war camp of Ingarûma\tShenzâmin stands by the side of the main tent of the war camp of Ingarûma.\n6\tTalk to Chief Provisioner Dunaïl in the war camp of Ingarûma\tChief Provisioner Dunaïl stands by his tent in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n7\tTalk to Kagûlu the Armsman in the war camp of Ingarûma\tKagûlu the Armsman is by the forges in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n8\tTalk to Kishâtal in the war camp of Ingarûma\tKishâtal is down the slope to the south-east of the forges in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n9\tTalk to Shenzâmin beside the main tent of the war camp of Ingarûma\tShenzâmin stands by the side of the main tent of the war camp of Ingarûma.\n",
[14874]="7007414B\n1\tDispose of the Ordâkhai trinkets in the barrel to the north-west\tShenzâmin thinks you should dispose of the Ordâkhai trinkets in the barrel beside the main tent of the war camp, to the north-west.\n2\tTalk to Shenzâmin in the war camp of Ingarûma\tShenzâmin stands beside the main tent of the war camp of Ingarûma.\n3\tDefeat Ordâkhai throughout Pahar Hatokáli (total: 12)\tShenzâmin asked you to defeat Ordâkhai throughout Pahar Hatokáli and to remain alert for the man who pretended to be Arimûl.\n4\tTalk to Shenzâmin in the war camp of Ingarûma\tShenzâmin stands beside the main tent of the war camp of Ingarûma.\n5\tPursue the fleeing man west through the gate of the war camp\tThe man pretending to be Arimûl was espied by one of the scouts, who pursued him west through the gate of the war camp!\n6\tTalk to Zilûki outside the west gate of the war camp of Ingarûma\tZilûki observes the work of her bow outside the west gate of the war camp of Ingarûma.\n7\tTalk to He Who Was Arimûl outside the west gate of the war camp of Ingarûma\tThe man who pretended to be Arimûl lies injured outside the west gate of the war camp of Ingarûma.\n8\tTalk to Shenzâmin outside the west gate of the war camp of Ingarûma\tShenzâmin stands outside the west gate of the war camp of Ingarûma.\n9\tTalk to Chief Provisioner Dunaïl in the war camp of Ingarûma\tChief Provisioner Dunaïl stands by his tent in the war camp of Ingarûma.\n",
[14875]="7007414E\n1\tRecover stolen grain from within Bolo Thúki (total: 6)\tThe Ordâkhai keep some of the grain they stole from Hanamíku in their camp of Bolo Thúki.\n2\tReturn the stolen grain to Bâdukhur in the village of Hanamíku\tBâdukhur should be waiting for his stolen grain back in the village of Hanamíku.\n",
[14876]="70074156\n1\tDefeat kalorkhûn at Abníshu ([see journal]/6)\tAt Abníshu, kalorkhûn stalk the salted-earth, a menace to any who may pass. The dwarves wish to thin the numbers of these terrifying birds, though not their young. With the elders removed, nature will take its course. Help the dwarves of An Shêru drive out the kalorkhûn at Abníshu. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[14877]="70074157\n1\tDefeat Adagím Huorns ([see journal]/10)\tEnemies abound in Adagím. Adagím Huorns spread the blight. The Kintai need assistance in destroying this enemy, the fungus they nurture, and identifying what malice they spread. Destroy these enemies across Adagím.\n",
[14878]="70074158\n1\tDefeat jázgai at Dân Shatagan ([see journal]/12)\tKighân is in recovery, but her people are plagued by many enemies. The people desire to see the jázgai near Dân Shatagan purged. Defeat jázgai at Dân Shatagan in Kighân.\n",
[14879]="70074159\n1\tSlay kalorkhûn matrons at Khatzâla ([see journal]/2)\030Slay kalorkhûn at Khatzâla ([see journal]/10)\tKighân is in recovery, but her people are plagued by many enemies. The people desire to see the terrifying birds called kalorkhûn at Khatzâla in Kighân purged, though not their young. With the elders removed, nature will take its course. Defeat kalorkhûn at Khatzâla in Kighân. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[14880]="7007415A\n1\tDefeat Adagím fen-amblers ([see journal]/12)\tEnemies abound in Adagím. Adagím fen-amblers drag the blight across Adagím. The Kintai need assistance in destroying this enemy, the fungus they nurture, and identifying what malice they spread. Destroy these enemies across Adagím.\n",
})
